      {
        "id": 38345,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-15T06:23:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As many times as I've played Visionary, I have never used Brain Burn.</p><p>I would go with players choice. &nbsp;I would probably just flip the trash upside down and put it under the deck, unless I had ordered it for bookkeeping purposes, in which case I'd probably shuffle it.</p><p>I only remember once actually contemplating it, vs. the Matriarch, but I didn't because we already had Flesh of the sun god and TtE on Matriarch so it wasn't worth it.</p>",
