      {
        "id": 38351,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-14T17:40:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Brain Burn is certainly an extremely situational card. I have only ever played it seriously on a few occassions, and they generally invloved either the Chairman, Dawn, or an Advanced OG Blade who has a scary good first 2 rounds.</p><p>You can choose the order the cards go under the deck though. I'd think that is a relativly safe bet.</p>",
