      {
        "id": 38357,
        "name": "Koga",
        "username": "Koga",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-05-16T07:55:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>With both Silver Gulch's Lost in the Past affecting the environment trash and now Freedom Tower's Ironclad Maintenance Bay, the trash order does matter. Ironclad Maintenance Bay puts the top card of each trash pile under its associated deck. We were playtesting when the previous comment was made so we couldn't exactly respond without giving away too much and by the time Vengeance came out this topic was pretty much buried.</p>",
        "post_number": 32,
        "post_type": 1,
