      {
        "id": 38358,
        "name": "McBehrer",
        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-05-19T01:44:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I asked Christopher about this at Gathering of Heroes, and he said that you are not allowed to reorder the trash. The order they are in is fixed. The obvious exception being when you have to shuffle it, like with Dawn, Omnitron, and Gloomweaver.</p>",
